  "_comment": "What each validator code module accepts (OpenSpec wpi-primitive-validators, design D4). Read by Go (validators.Modules) and TypeScript (web/src/lib/wpi/validators). Constraints are listed in the order their checks run; default is the code default (absent: not applied until set). error_codes give each code's params.",
